  "description": {
    "raw": "You channel negative energy through your touch, fatiguing the target. You must succeed on a touch attack to strike a target. The subject is immediately fatigued for the spell's duration.\n\nThis spell has no effect on a creature that is already fatigued. Unlike with normal fatigue, the effect ends as soon as the spell's duration expires.",
    "search_text": "\"you channel negative energy through your touch, fatiguing the target. you must succeed on a touch attack to strike a target. the subject is immediately fatigued for the spell's duration.\\n\\nthis spell has no effect on a creature that is already fatigued. unlike with normal fatigue, the effect ends as soon as the spell's duration expires.\"",
